OL,3,GNEWSAMan who committed first rape at 14
OL,4,Ajailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who raped a girl when he was
OL,7,F14 has been jailed for sexual offences
OL,8,Fagainst multiple victims.
OL,10,FPolice said Reuben Thomson committed 22
OL,11,Foffences between 2021 and 2025 against
OL,12,Fsix victims aged from 11 to 21.
OL,14,FThe offences came to light after one
OL,15,Fvictim told her mother what had
OL,16,Fhappened, which Thomson initially
OL,17,Fdenied, but he later admitted the
OL,18,Foffences in August.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
